                  <i class="fa-solid fa-microphone-lines" aria-hidden="true" />{" "}
                  Open Mic
                </h3>
                <p>
                  Area 1, all day, hosted by the{" "}
                  <a href="https://302omad.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
